<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu, McDonnell to develop software in U.S..</title>
<headline>Fujitsu, McDonnell to develop software in U.S..</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Ltd and the U.S. unit of Britain's McDonnell Information Systems Plc will set up a joint venture in California to develop software, Fujitsu said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new firm, Glovia International, will develop package software for manufacturing companies' production and sales control and have a staff of about 230, a Fujitsu spokesman said.</p>
<p>Fujitsu will announce more details at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT).</p>
</text>
